{"seq":1,"slug":"sync-async-semi-replication","title":"同步、异步与半同步复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-consistency/sync-async-semi-replication","wordCount":2243,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"同步-异步与半同步复制\">同步、异步与半同步复制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>复制模式回答的是一个时序问题：<strong>主库在什么时刻把「提交成功」返回给客户端</strong>。这一个时刻的选择，决定了写入延迟的量级、写入可用性的下限、以及故障发生时可能丢失多少已提交的数据——三者由同一个决定连带产生，无法各自优化。因此复制模式不是「越高同步越好」的调优项，而是一个必须与业务对延迟、可用性、持久性的真实容忍度对齐的架构决策。</p>\n<p>三种模式的差别可以用一个统一模型刻画：设主库在本地提交后需要等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本确认，一共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{write} = L_{local} + k \\cdot RTT_{avg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是异步复制：返回时间与副本无关，写入延迟最低，但主库崩溃时尚未传播的已提交事务永久丢失。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\ge 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是半同步复制：至少等一个副本确认，保证至少有一个异地副本拥有该事务。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是全同步复制：所有副本确认才返回，写入延迟等于最慢副本的往返时间，任一副本不可用都会阻塞写入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[客户端提交] --&gt; L[主库本地提交&lt;br/&gt;写 WAL]&#10;  L --&gt; W{等待策略}&#10;  W --&gt;|k=0| A[立即返回&lt;br/&gt;异步传播]&#10;  W --&gt;|k=1| S[等 1 个异地副本 ACK]&#10;  W --&gt;|k=N| F[等全部副本 ACK]&#10;  A --&gt; R1[延迟最低&lt;br/&gt;故障可能丢数据]&#10;  S --&gt; R2[延迟 +1 RTT&lt;br/&gt;至少一处有副本]&#10;  F --&gt; R3[延迟最慢副本 RTT&lt;br/&gt;可用性最低]\">graph TD\n  C[客户端提交] --&gt; L[主库本地提交&lt;br/&gt;写 WAL]\n  L --&gt; W{等待策略}\n  W --&gt;|k=0| A[立即返回&lt;br/&gt;异步传播]\n  W --&gt;|k=1| S[等 1 个异地副本 ACK]\n  W --&gt;|k=N| F[等全部副本 ACK]\n  A --&gt; R1[延迟最低&lt;br/&gt;故障可能丢数据]\n  S --&gt; R2[延迟 +1 RTT&lt;br/&gt;至少一处有副本]\n  F --&gt; R3[延迟最慢副本 RTT&lt;br/&gt;可用性最低]</pre><h2 id=\"三种模式的量化代价\">三种模式的量化代价</h2><p>把上面的公式代进真实链路，可以得到一个直观的对比。以一个跨太平洋 RTT 约 140ms、同洲跨区 RTT 约 30ms 的部署为例，假设主库本地处理 3ms：</p>\n<h3 id=\"延迟与丢失窗口对照\">延迟与丢失窗口对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>等待对象</th>\n<th>写入延迟</th>\n<th>主库故障丢失窗口</th>\n<th>写入可用性下限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>~3ms</td>\n<td>最大：复制队列中全部事务</td>\n<td>主库与本地存储可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半同步（同洲副本）</td>\n<td>1 个同洲副本</td>\n<td>~33ms</td>\n<td>一个 RTT 内的事务</td>\n<td>主库 + 该副本可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半同步（跨洋副本）</td>\n<td>1 个跨洋副本</td>\n<td>~143ms</td>\n<td>一个 RTT 内的事务</td>\n<td>主库 + 该副本可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全同步</td>\n<td>全部副本</td>\n<td>最慢副本 RTT</td>\n<td>无（若全部确认）</td>\n<td>全部副本可用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"两个常被混淆的点\">两个常被混淆的点</h3><p>这张表揭示了两件常被混淆的事。第一，<strong>半同步的持久性保证与它选择的副本位置强相关</strong>：等一个同洲副本确认，只保证数据在同洲有两个副本，一场区域级故障仍可能同时带走两者。要让「至少一个异地副本拥有该事务」成立，等待对象必须是异地副本，代价就是跨洋 RTT 进入写入路径。第二，<strong>全同步几乎从不在跨区域部署中使用</strong>：它把写入可用性降到「全部副本同时可用」，而跨区链路的抖动频率远高于单机故障，实际结果往往是写入频繁阻塞。</p>\n<h3 id=\"半同步的退化行为\">半同步的退化行为</h3><p>半同步最需要提前决定的是<strong>当等待的副本不响应时怎么办</strong>。两种退化策略在语义上完全不同：</p>\n<p><strong>退化为异步（超时后继续）。</strong> 等待超过阈值仍未收到确认，主库继续返回成功并降级为异步传播，恢复后再补上。这保住了可用性，但放弃了持久性承诺——退化期间提交的事务可能丢失，而且退化通常是静默的，除非显式监控。适合能容忍偶发数据丢失、但不能接受写入停顿的场景。</p>\n<p><strong>退化为阻塞（拒绝写入）。</strong> 等待副本确认，直到超时后直接让写入失败。这保住了持久性语义，但把复制链路的健康直接变成写入可用性的一部分。适合不能容忍丢数据的场景，但必须配套监控，否则一次链路故障会变成全球写入不可用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退化策略</th>\n<th>保住</th>\n<th>放弃</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>必备监控</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>退化为异步</td>\n<td>写入可用性</td>\n<td>持久性承诺</td>\n<td>可容忍偶发丢数据</td>\n<td>退化时长与次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退化为阻塞</td>\n<td>持久性语义</td>\n<td>写入可用性</td>\n<td>不可丢数据的核心表</td>\n<td>链路健康与阻塞告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中第三种做法更常见：<strong>按表或按语句选择策略</strong>。核心账务表用阻塞式半同步，日志与埋点表用异步，中间层用超时降级加显式告警。这要求数据库或中间件支持按写路径配置复制策略，而且配置本身必须可审计——否则「这张表到底是同步还是异步」会成为事故复盘时说不清的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组提交与写入吞吐上限\">组提交与写入吞吐上限</h2><p>跨区复制的另一个隐性代价是<strong>吞吐</strong>。每次提交都要付出一个 RTT 的等待，如果每个事务独立等待，那么单连接串行提交的吞吐上限就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/RTT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。以 140ms 计，单连接每秒只能完成约 7 笔事务——这显然不可接受，而实际的数据库通过组提交（group commit）解决了它。</p>\n<h3 id=\"组提交如何分摊-rtt\">组提交如何分摊 RTT</h3><p>组提交的原理是：主库把在一个等待窗口内到达的多笔事务合并成一次批次，用一次网络往返等待整批的确认，从而把 RTT 的代价分摊到多个事务上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Throughput_{max} \\approx \\frac{B_{batch}}{RTT}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{batch}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是批次中平均事务数，它随并发提交数增长。这解释了为什么同步复制在实际系统中并不像公式暗示的那样致命：只要并发足够，RTT 被分摊掉。但它也解释了另一个现象——<strong>低并发时同步复制会显著变慢</strong>。一个夜间批处理任务如果串行提交，每笔都要等一个 RTT，原本 1 秒能跑完的作业会变成几分钟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"参数骨架\">参数骨架</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"# 半同步复制的典型参数骨架（概念示意，具体参数名随数据库实现而异）&#10;[replication]&#10;mode                  = semisync&#10;wait_for_replicas     = 1&#10;wait_timeout_ms       = 1000&#10;on_timeout            = degrade_to_async   # 或 reject_write&#10;group_commit_window_us = 200               # 组提交合并窗口&#10;priority_replica      = &quot;eu-central-1&quot;     # 优先等待的异地副本&#10;fallback_replica      = &quot;ap-southeast-2&quot;   # 主副本不可用时的次选&#10;degrade_alert_after_s = 30                 # 静默退化多久后告警\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 半同步复制的典型参数骨架（概念示意，具体参数名随数据库实现而异）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[replication]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mode                  = semisync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wait_for_replicas     = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wait_timeout_ms       = 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>on_timeout            = degrade_to_async   # 或 reject_write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>group_commit_window_us = 200               # 组提交合并窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>priority_replica      = \"eu-central-1\"     # 优先等待的异地副本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fallback_replica      = \"ap-southeast-2\"   # 主副本不可用时的次选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>degrade_alert_after_s = 30                 # 静默退化多久后告警</span></span></code></pre></div><p>参数 <code>group_commit_window_us</code> 是吞吐与延迟的调节点：窗口越大，批次越大、吞吐越高，但单笔事务的平均延迟也越高。把它设成 0 意味着每笔独立等待，吞吐最差；设成几毫秒通常是较好的折中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复制模式与故障切换的耦合\">复制模式与故障切换的耦合</h2><p>复制模式的选择直接决定了第三章的 RPO 能取到什么值，这一点必须在选型时一并确认，而不能等到设计容灾方案时才发现目标不可达。</p>\n<h3 id=\"异步复制的-rpo-只能是期望值\">异步复制的 RPO 只能是期望值</h3><p>异步复制下，任何时刻主库上「已提交但未传播」的事务数量决定了切换时的丢失上限。这个量不是常数：它随写入速率与复制延迟波动，写入高峰时可能比低谷时大一个数量级。因此异步复制的 RPO 只能表述为「在给定写入速率与延迟分布下的期望值」，而不是一个固定秒数——具体计算方法见<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/region-failover-promotion\">区域故障检测与主提升</a>与<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/failover-rto-rpo\">RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"半同步保证必须有提升判据配套\">半同步保证必须有提升判据配套</h3><p>半同步复制下，RPO 的上界可以收紧为「等待副本尚未确认的那部分事务」，通常远小于异步。但要注意一个反向风险：半同步保证了至少一个副本有数据，却没有保证<strong>切换时选中的是那个副本</strong>。如果自动化流程在提升时选了另一个落后更多的副本，持久性保证就白费了。因此半同步的落地必须与「提升时如何判定最新副本」配套实现，判据是日志位置而非副本的地理位置或健康状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>复制模式的本质是选择「提交成功」的返回时刻，这一个决定连带决定写入延迟、写入可用性与故障丢失窗口，三者不可独立优化。</li>\n<li>统一模型为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{write} = L_{local} + k \\cdot RTT_{avg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：k=0 异步延迟最低但可能丢数据，k≥1 半同步保证至少一处有副本，k=N 全同步在跨区部署中几乎不可用。</li>\n<li>半同步的持久性保证与<strong>等待副本的位置</strong>强相关：只等同洲副本无法抵御区域级故障，要保证异地有副本就必须把跨洋 RTT 放进写入路径。</li>\n<li>半同步必须提前决定退化策略：退化为异步保住可用性但静默放弃持久性，退化为阻塞保住语义但把链路健康变成写入可用性；实用做法是按表配置并监控退化时长。</li>\n<li>组提交把 RTT 代价分摊到批次上，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Throughput \\approx B_{batch}/RTT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，因此同步复制在高并发下可接受、在低并发串行提交时极其昂贵。</li>\n<li>复制模式直接决定 RPO 上界，且半同步的持久性保证只有在「提升时按日志位置选最新副本」时才能兑现，见<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/split-brain-fencing\">脑裂防护与隔离</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"同步、异步与半同步复制","id":"同步-异步与半同步复制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三种模式的量化代价","id":"三种模式的量化代价"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟与丢失窗口对照","id":"延迟与丢失窗口对照"},{"level":3,"text":"两个常被混淆的点","id":"两个常被混淆的点"},{"level":3,"text":"半同步的退化行为","id":"半同步的退化行为"},{"level":2,"text":"组提交与写入吞吐上限","id":"组提交与写入吞吐上限"},{"level":3,"text":"组提交如何分摊 RTT","id":"组提交如何分摊-rtt"},{"level":3,"text":"参数骨架","id":"参数骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"复制模式与故障切换的耦合","id":"复制模式与故障切换的耦合"},{"level":3,"text":"异步复制的 RPO 只能是期望值","id":"异步复制的-rpo-只能是期望值"},{"level":3,"text":"半同步保证必须有提升判据配套","id":"半同步保证必须有提升判据配套"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据主权与就近读写路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/multiregion-topology/sovereignty-data-routing"},"next":{"title":"复制延迟与读己之写、单调读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-consistency/replication-lag-read"}}